OL,3,GNEWSAHeat and drought put record demand
OL,4,Aon fire service
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters faced "record-breaking"
OL,7,Fdemand over the summer, responding to
OL,8,Fmore than 2,000 incidents in one month
OL,9,Falone, a fire service has said.
OL,11,FDevon and Somerset Fire and Rescue said
OL,12,Fprolonged hot and dry weather led to
OL,13,Fsustained and unprecedented levels of
OL,14,Fdemand, particularly in July.
OL,16,FThe service said control room staff
OL,17,Fhandled 6,041 calls during the month,
OL,18,Fwhile firefighters attended 2,008
OL,19,Fincidents, including 864 fires. Of
OL,20,Fthose, 547 were classed as open-air
OL,21,Ffires.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
