OL,3,GNEWSAHeat and drought put record demand
OL,4,Aon fire service
OL,5,
OL,6,FKate Saint, the service's head of
OL,7,Fprevention, said it dealt with
OL,8,F"sustained levels of demand in
OL,9,Fchallenging conditions", adding "many
OL,10,Fpeople changed their behaviour as the
OL,11,Frisk increased".
